{"id":"n71281-7-7","stage":1,"title":"시원하다 · 舒畅","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71281-7-7-1","ko":"내가 지수한테 욕을 실컷 해 줬어!","zh":"我把智秀骂了个痛快！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"지수한테","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"지수한테","audio":"/audio/8193d62d9944d3738746.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수한테","audio":"/audio/8193d62d9944d3738746.mp3"}},{"text":"욕을","meaning":"骂，辱骂","explanation":"욕：骂，辱骂；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"욕","audio":"/audio/b2974a63b590dbc9424d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26624","senseId":"1","lemma":"욕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"욕을","audio":"/audio/b273295167395fa8d73b.mp3"}},{"text":"실컷","meaning":"狠狠地","explanation":"실컷：狠狠地。","readings":[{"term":"실컷","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14126","senseId":"2","lemma":"실컷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실컷","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"骂","explanation":"욕을 하다 是“骂人”；这里的 하다 不单独译作一般的“做”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"줬어!","meaning":"对她狠狠骂了一通","explanation":"욕을 해 줬어 在这里是冲着智秀骂，并不是帮她做一件好事。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줬어","audio":"/audio/71e4d6f04c5b2aec4173.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b2974a63b590dbc9","term":"욕","zh":"骂，辱骂","audio":"/audio/b2974a63b590dbc9424d.mp3","entryId":"26624","definition":"无视或责备别人的下流的话语。","pronunciation":["욕"]},{"id":"5f58ab67054aac9b","term":"실컷","zh":"狠狠地","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3","entryId":"14126","definition":"非常厉害地。","pronunciation":["실컫"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"骂（욕을 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"与 욕 连用表示骂人。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"对对方施加动作（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"与 욕을 하다 连用，强调骂话冲着对方而去；不是对她提供帮助。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/61829db2133333211693.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71281-7-7-2","ko":"잘했어! 내 속이 다 시원하네.","zh":"干得好！我总算解气了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘했어!","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘했어","audio":"/audio/b0806d21aa41f28ffcfd.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我的","explanation":"내 是 나의 的缩略形式，修饰后面的 속。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"속이","meaning":"心里","explanation":"속이 시원하다 表示心里的郁闷散去、觉得解气。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"4","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속이","audio":"/audio/6f6688764f24b1ca69ac.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"시원하네.","meaning":"舒畅，舒服","explanation":"시원하다：舒畅，舒服；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"7","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원하네","audio":"/audio/d7043551ad89bfa298cc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"棒","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得好、优秀。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"心里","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"속이 시원하다 在这里指心情舒畅、解气。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"舒畅，舒服","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"郁闷的心情得到缓解，轻松痛快。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f25f9fb45317d0f904e9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.276,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71281","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"7","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.5149,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["干得好！我总算解气了。","再等我十分钟吧。","我把智秀骂了个痛快！"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["干得好！我总算解气了。","我把智秀骂了个痛快！","再等我十分钟吧。"],"answer":0}]}
